OL,3,GNEWSADog lovers to take on African
OL,4,Ariver challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree dog lovers are swapping leads for
OL,7,Foars to take on an epic adventure of
OL,8,Fpaddling 120km (75 miles) along one of
OL,9,FAfrica's largest rivers.
OL,11,FKelly Magee, 49, who owns Immingham
OL,12,FDogs Home in North Lincolnshire, will
OL,13,Fbe joined by volunteers Erica Fox, 39,
OL,14,Fand her partner, Ryan Day, 40, as they
OL,15,Ftackle the Zambezi River.
OL,17,FThey hope the challenge will raise
OL,18,Fmuch-needed funds for the charity,
OL,19,Fwhich nurtures and finds homes for dogs
OL,20,Fthat come into its care and relies
OL,21,F"solely on public donations", Erica
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
