OL,3,GNEWSADog lovers to take on African
OL,4,Ariver challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs well as being amateurs when it comes
OL,7,Fto kayaking and canoeing, Kelly added:
OL,8,F"It's not just the water stuff, there
OL,9,Fare crocodiles and hippos, everything
OL,10,Fthat comes with a river."
